## Prose patterns

Markup the build transforms on its way out, and the one style rule that shows itself only at phone width.

### External links

Every absolute link to another host gets `target="_blank"` and `rel="noopener noreferrer"` added by the `externalLinks` transform in `.eleventy.js`: [the Lit docs](https://lit.dev) leaves the site in a new tab, [the blog index](/blog/) does not. Links that already declare a `target`, and links back to this host, are left untouched.

Pair an external link with the `external` glyph where the destination deserves a visual cue: <a href="https://lit.dev">lit.dev <sz-icon name="external" size="12"></sz-icon></a>

### Keyboard hints

`<kbd>` is the element for a key the reader is meant to press. A chord joins keys with `+`, a sequence separates them with a space, exactly as the command palette's own help page prints them.

<kbd>Alt</kbd> + <kbd>1</kbd> switches to the first tab, <kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>g</kbd> jumps to the top of the document, and <kbd>?</kbd> opens the man page.

### Video embeds

A bare `<iframe>` in the source is wrapped in a `.embed-container` by `sz-markdown`, which snaps it to the nearest line-height multiple so the embed keeps the page's baseline grid. Only `youtube-nocookie.com` is reachable: the CSP declares it as the single permitted `frame-src`.

<iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/0xssf2x0whg" title="Cherry Pulp" allowfullscreen></iframe>

### Wide tables on narrow screens

Below 768px a prose table drops one font step, tightens its cell padding and becomes a horizontally scrollable block. The table below is deliberately wider than a phone column, so it is the one that demonstrates the scroll rather than the fit.

| Binding | Scope | WCAG 2.1.4 gate | Source | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `:` `/` `?` | `global` | not gated | `sz-palette.ts` | The switch's own control surface |
| `l` | `page` | gated | `sz-links.ts` | Desktop only |
| `Alt`+`1`–`9` | `page` | not gated | `sz-tmux-bar.ts` | Modified, so exempt |
| `Escape` | `always` | not gated | `core/keymap.ts` | Acts above every other question |

